OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 7 MAY
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Bartok
OL,5,     GThe world plunges into war, with
OL,6,     GHungary at the centre. Donald
OL,7,     GMacleod explores the life of one
OL,8,     Gof Hungary's greatest composers,
OL,9,     Gwho travelled Europe recording
OL,10,     Gfolk songs.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GLive music from The United
OL,13,     GStrings of Europe. Anna Clyne on
OL,14,     Gthe world premiere of her work
OL,15,     GSirens.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,19,     Gfavourites from composers such as
OL,20,     GMendelssohn, Scarlatti and Mel
OL,21,     GBonis.
