OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 7 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GSir Mark Elder is reunited with
OL,6,     Gthe Halle Orchestra and Choir in
OL,7,     Ga programme of music by Glinka,
OL,8,     GRachmaninov, Stravinsky, and
OL,9,     GTchaikovsky.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: The Insect Singers
OL,11,     GThe Essay celebrates the
OL,12,     Gmusicality of Earth's insect
OL,13,     Gsingers. Autumn Cricket Song. A
OL,14,     Gbeautiful song of stridulation
OL,15,     Gthat begins in summer and edges
OL,16,     Ginto the melancholy of autumn.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
